Deviations
- The plan step 1 draft command has no --book-pages flag. The text gate needs drafts with this flag (the baseline of the teaching loops track). The role used the flag. The plan text of the Print proof task still shows the old command. The PM or the orchestrator can add the flag to the plan.
- The role used a Python heredoc for the first plan edit (the [~] line), and shell redirects (the characters less-than and greater-than) in scratch commands: a sed with an output file and two while-read loops that read /tmp/opencode/p9-fold/files.lst. These commands read files or wrote scratch files only. They changed no file of the repository and no existing folder. All captures use tee.
- MANIFEST.txt uses the line format "sha256, two spaces, path" with the header and the sizes as comment lines starting with "# ". The format of proof-books-r6-v1 had a size column, and sha256sum -c cannot read that format. The result is that sha256sum -c MANIFEST.txt exits 0, and a second check (size lines) agrees.
- The first manifest capture printed the exit status of tail in place of sha256sum. The role ran the check again with the true exit status. The committed capture is the second one.
- The plan line numbers named in the brief (668 to 675) had moved to 673 to 681 because of earlier commits. The role edited by exact text.
- The scratch folder /tmp/opencode/p9-fold was removed at the end. The look sheets, which were in this folder, are not kept.
- No pnpm-lock.yaml change. The file video/storytime-song/scripts/render.mjs and the other files of other sessions were not touched.

